usage: logs_lifecycle.py [-h] [--node-dir NODE_DIR] [--now NOW]
                         [--raw-days RAW_DAYS]
                         [--compressed-days COMPRESSED_DAYS]
                         [--cap-mib CAP_MIB] [--apply] [--self-test]

docs/logs 수명 집행

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --node-dir NODE_DIR   docs/logs/<node_id>
  --now NOW             YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ (벽시계 금지)
  --raw-days RAW_DAYS
  --compressed-days COMPRESSED_DAYS
  --cap-mib CAP_MIB
  --apply               기본은 dry-run
  --self-test
